              <p class="text-[#16A34A] font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Cleaners</p>
              <h3 class="text-gray-900 font-bold text-lg group-hover:text-[#1E90FF] transition-colors">Best Driveway Cleaners</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-2">The chemistry that does what pressure cannot.</p>
            </a>
          </div>
